OL,3,ABrazilian authorities question
OL,4,Awhereabouts of Flavio Bolsonaro after
OL,5,Ahe fails to surrender passports
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Monday, the Supreme Court gave
OL,8,FBolsonaro 24 hours to hand over his
OL,9,Fpassports. With the deadline passed,
OL,10,Fthere is speculation the senator may
OL,11,Fhave left the country
OL,13,FFederal officers have checked border
OL,14,Fcrossings to establish if Bolsonaro may
OL,15,Fhave travelled to neighbouring
OL,16,FArgentina, a police source tells BBC
OL,17,FNews Brasil
OL,19,FRight-wing candidate Bolsonaro, 45,
OL,20,Flost the election to left-wing rival,
OL,21,FPresident Luiz Inacio Lula da Silva.
OL,22,FBolsonaro is yet to accept the result
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
